        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The FENRIS Strides up to double its Speed and makes a <strong>Shock Claws</strong> Strike at the end of that movement. If it began its turn more than 30 feet from the target, the Strike gains a +1 circumstance bonus to the attack roll and the target is <strong>off-guard</strong> against it for this Strike.</p>",
